Subject: [PATCH 14/14] powerpc/pseries: exceptions use short handler load again
Date: Thu, 21 Jul 2016 16:44:13 +1000
Message-Id: <1469083453-9279-15-git-send-email-npiggin@gmail.com>
In-Reply-To: <1469083453-9279-1-git-send-email-npiggin@gmail.com>
